s middleware and entry filename for Workers;","+keep the `ASSETS` binding and both output directories together. `.assetsignore` excludes the","+Worker entry and Pages control files from public static assets.","+","+Verify the deployment bundle without publishing:","+","+```sh","+pnpm -C packages/insights deploy.dry-run","+```","+","+The `main` branch CI builds and validates these artifacts. Production's existing","+`Deploy Insights` workflow lives on `v1` and deploys that branch; merging into `main` alone","+does not publish the v2 dashboard. An intentional production rollout must select the v2","+source and run `pnpm -C packages/insights deploy` after verification.","+","+Keep `PRIVATE_LIBSQL_DB_API_TOKEN`, `PRIVATE_AUTH_SECRET`, and `PRIVATE_GITHUB_SECRET` in","+Cloudflare Worker secrets. For local Workers testing, put the local development values from","+`.env.local` in the ignored `.dev.vars` file and run","+`pnpm -C packages/insights serve.cloudflare` after building. Use separate credentials for","+staging and register its GitHub OAuth callback."," "," Before promotion:"," ","@@ -93,5 +111,5 @@ Before promotion:"," - Send manifests, symbol events, and error events from both Qwik v1 and v2 fixture applications","   to a registered staging application. Confirm ingestion, dashboard results, and bundle strategy","   responses, including cross-origin browser requests.","-- Confirm the rendered page reports the expected `q:version`. Retain the previous Netlify deploy","+- Confirm the rendered page reports the expected `q:version`. Retain the previous Worker version","   for rollback and verify database compatibility before rolling back application code."],"additions":24,"deletions":6,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/insights/adapters/cloudflare-workers/vite.config.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@","+import { cloudflarePagesAdapter } from '@qwik.dev/router/adapters/cloudflare-pages/vite';","+import { extendConfig } from '@qwik.dev/router/vite';","+import baseConfig 